{"format":1,"id":"klaenge_hoeren","kurz":"kh","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Klänge wahrnehmen","untertitel":"Den Geräuschen ringsum zuhören, wie sie kommen und gehen, ohne sie zu bewerten.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":180},"normal":{"ziel_s":480},"lang":{"ziel_s":900}},"kb":626,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/1.9b59e9ab.mp3","ms":3148,"text":"Setz dich bequem hin, oder leg dich hin.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.4}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/2.671f7fcf.mp3","ms":5835,"text":"Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.4}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/3.d369946d.mp3","ms":7209,"text":"Bei dieser Übung hörst du einfach zu. Es gibt nichts Richtiges oder Falsches zu hören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.4}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/4.8d177f58.mp3","ms":2054,"text":"Atme ein paarmal ruhig.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":7}}]},{"id":"nah","segmente":[{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/5.77a3aa99.mp3","ms":6708,"text":"Lausch zuerst auf Geräusche ganz in deiner Nähe. Im Raum, an deinem Körper.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":10.2}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/6.1b311aa1.mp3","ms":6638,"text":"Vielleicht dein Atem. Das Rascheln deiner Kleidung. Ein Ticken.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":20.1,"normal":59.6,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"fern","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/7.ed0ef267.mp3","ms":6353,"text":"Lass das Hören jetzt weiter werden. Zu Geräuschen draußen, weiter weg.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":10.2}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/8.f6e17918.mp3","ms":6599,"text":"Autos, Wind, Stimmen, Vögel. Was immer gerade da ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":20.1,"normal":59.6,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"eigenschaften","segmente":[{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/9.63bd0a93.mp3","ms":5477,"text":"Du musst die Geräusche nicht benennen. Hör nur, wie sie klingen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":10.2}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/10.b8229ca0.mp3","ms":6246,"text":"Laut oder leise. Hoch oder tief. Kurz oder lang.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13.9}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/11.fa7a1f06.mp3","ms":4556,"text":"Wie ein Klang beginnt, eine Weile da ist und wieder verschwindet.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":59.6,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"stille_dazwischen","segmente":[{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/12.28bb9c5c.mp3","ms":3404,"text":"Hör jetzt auch auf die Stille zwischen den Geräuschen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":20.1,"normal":59.6,"lang":62}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/13.053ad26e.mp3","ms":3530,"text":"Die Stille ist immer da, auch wenn es laut ist.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}}]},{"id":"gedanken","segmente":[{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/14.b200641f.mp3","ms":4034,"text":"Wenn ein Gedanke kommt, behandle ihn wie ein Geräusch.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":10.2}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/15.7871f0f8.mp3","ms":3804,"text":"Er taucht auf, ist eine Weile da und vergeht wieder.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13.9}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/16.c4aabe66.mp3","ms":1763,"text":"Du musst ihm nicht folgen.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":62}}]},{"id":"offen","segmente":[{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/17.294a4a04.mp3","ms":5961,"text":"Lass jetzt alles zu, was zu hören ist. Ohne etwas zu suchen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/18.ee0a5ef6.mp3","ms":5694,"text":"Wenn du merkst, dass du abgeschweift bist, komm einfach zurück zu den Klängen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":20.1,"normal":59.6,"lang":65.5}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/19.c1e65a47.mp3","ms":5335,"text":"Hör, wie die Geräusche ganz von allein kommen, ohne dass du etwas tun musst.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/20.ba24079b.mp3","ms":2215,"text":"Langsam kommst du zum Ende.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.4}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/21.0bd8bd64.mp3","ms":3369,"text":"Spür deinen Körper, wie er sitzt oder liegt.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":7}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/22.2a7a3ed1.mp3","ms":2569,"text":"Atme einmal tief ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.4}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/23.f9dd84fc.mp3","ms":2936,"text":"Öffne die Augen, wenn du so weit bist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3.2}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}